      "instance_name": "misleading_labeling",
      "label": "misleading_labeling",
      "description": "The meme uses a deliberate and false labeling technique, where an image is paired with text that creates a misleading or absurd connection. This is a common rhetorical device in internet humor, often used to provoke laughter through shock value or absurdity. Understanding this rhetorical strategy is necessary to interpret the meme's intent and its potential to trivialize serious topics.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_3faded31"
