      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "absurdity_for_humor",
      "label": "absurdity_for_humor",
      "description": "The humor in the meme is derived from the absurdity of the comparison between a mundane, everyday scene (a baby exploring a dishwasher) and a major life event (childbirth). This type of humor relies on the unexpected juxtaposition of unrelated concepts to create comedic effect, which requires understanding the cultural context of humor and satire.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
