      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text_chunk 'rare picture of child birth' because the meme relies on the viewer's interpretation of the absurd and misleading label to generate humor. The user must engage with the text to understand the joke, making the text the focal point of the semiotic projection. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the projection is implicit through the viewer's cognitive engagement with the text's false equivalence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
